00:08:51.315 --> 00:08:56.735
trade against the NASDAQ over its own sessions, not a compounded path nobody can reproduce

00:08:56.735 --> 00:08:58.095
from the published entries.

00:08:58.575 --> 00:09:04.815
The rules-based record that started August 18th, 2026, fixed five session holds, entry

00:09:04.815 --> 00:09:13.055
at the next open, stop or horizon, no discretionary exits, shows matched window alpha of minus 0.76%

00:09:13.055 --> 00:09:18.895
